  "text": "How agency founders track gross revenue, collected cash, and profit margins every Friday. Founders spend Friday afternoons wrestling with QuickBooks, exporting spreadsheets, and calculating net margins by hand. Delaying financial reviews until monthly bookkeeping leaves leadership blind to cash crunches and runaway contractor expenses. Connect Stripe and QuickBooks to Slack using Make to dispatch an automated executive financial summary every Friday. You gain cash flow clarity in thirty seconds.",
